WEBVTT

00:01.395 --> 00:03.725
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.835 --> 00:06.895
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.365 --> 00:10.105
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.105 --> 00:14.765
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.175 --> 00:22.175
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.885 --> 00:26.755
Dragon Drive

00:26.755 --> 00:32.285
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.395 --> 00:35.365
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.365 --> 00:38.625
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.105 --> 00:43.475
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.475 --> 00:45.445
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.445 --> 00:51.775
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.485 --> 00:55.855
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.855 --> 00:59.085
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.385 --> 01:04.395
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.395 --> 01:05.985
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.095 --> 01:08.495
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.495 --> 01:11.665
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.035 --> 01:17.105
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.105 --> 01:19.845
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.845 --> 01:27.545
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.225 --> 01:41.715
Why won't you fight against me?!

01:41.935 --> 01:43.865
Because I have no reason to fight you!

01:43.995 --> 01:44.985
What?!

01:46.865 --> 01:49.425
I never was friends with Kouhei.

01:49.535 --> 01:51.195
I cannot fight alongside you!

01:51.505 --> 01:53.565
Hayate Slash!

02:04.855 --> 02:06.345
Stop it, already!

02:06.685 --> 02:08.675
I trust him!

02:08.725 --> 02:10.385
Then I shall get rid of you as well!

02:12.725 --> 02:13.925
Stop it!

02:19.405 --> 02:21.095
I also trust you.

02:24.405 --> 02:27.935
Runaway

02:48.065 --> 02:49.365
Owww!

02:49.395 --> 02:51.385
Cut it out already, Chibi!

02:52.665 --> 02:54.105
Owww!

02:54.135 --> 02:56.005
What do you think you're doing?!

02:56.105 --> 02:59.305
If you're unable to transform
like last time because of your hunger...

02:59.345 --> 03:01.465
...we'll have no chance
against that legendary dragon!

03:01.575 --> 03:04.105
That's why I'm considering your needs
and carrying you on my back like this.

03:04.315 --> 03:05.905
And this is how you thank me!

03:07.045 --> 03:10.955
Okay, I get it, so let go!
I apologize!

03:21.435 --> 03:22.415
Stop!

03:22.795 --> 03:24.285
Don't move another step!

03:29.705 --> 03:31.695
Oh, it's only some old man.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.475
Don't scare me like that!

03:34.615 --> 03:38.705
This mountain is where
the holy dragon SinnSaber lives.

03:39.285 --> 03:41.745
It's a sacred area where none shall trespass.

03:42.155 --> 03:45.555
I suggest that you turn around
and leave this holy ground.

03:45.655 --> 03:47.815
Did you say SinnSaber?!

03:47.855 --> 03:50.185
So it does exist!

03:50.355 --> 03:51.555
Thank you, old man!

03:51.865 --> 03:53.195
You mustn't go!

03:53.295 --> 03:56.735
SinnSaber will never forgive anyone
who desecrates the mountain.

03:56.935 --> 03:58.555
That suits me just fine!

03:58.765 --> 04:01.165
It's SinnSaber that we came here to fight.

04:01.975 --> 04:04.165
Don't bother. You won't succeed.

04:04.505 --> 04:05.375
Huh?

04:05.745 --> 04:10.675
Many dragon masters have
climbed this mountain in the past...

04:10.715 --> 04:12.475
...saying they would defeat SinnSaber.

04:12.585 --> 04:13.575
However...

04:13.945 --> 04:16.575
...not a single one of them returned.

04:16.915 --> 04:19.255
What you see here is how they've ended up.

04:19.355 --> 04:20.285
But...

04:20.355 --> 04:22.185
...I have to go there.

04:22.395 --> 04:24.515
You won't beat SinnSaber.

04:24.695 --> 04:26.425
Don't go wasting your life!

04:29.335 --> 04:30.795
I've come this far.

04:30.835 --> 04:32.625
I can't just give it up at this point.

04:32.865 --> 04:34.695
I've already decided
that I'll finish what I started!

04:37.035 --> 04:39.205
I'll be sure to return.

04:42.715 --> 04:44.175
You poor fool.

04:44.275 --> 04:47.305
All the others said the same thing
and never returned.

04:55.695 --> 04:57.215
So this is where that dragon resides.

04:57.595 --> 05:00.395
The legendary dragon, SinnSaber.

05:08.275 --> 05:09.235
Stop, Kouhei!

05:10.475 --> 05:12.235
Because of the unstable transfer device...

05:12.475 --> 05:14.665
...your body was seriously injured!

05:15.115 --> 05:16.075
Don't overdo it!

05:16.475 --> 05:18.245
You're bossing me around?

05:18.445 --> 05:20.575
You've become quite the hotshot, Agent G.

05:20.845 --> 05:21.835
Kouhei.

05:22.515 --> 05:24.245
Stop acting like you're my older brother.

05:24.655 --> 05:27.145
I've grown tired of looking at your face.

05:27.425 --> 05:28.485
I'm not surprised.

05:28.995 --> 05:30.895
I've known you for a long time, after all.

05:33.165 --> 05:37.595
The Dragon Drive system
being developed by President Toki...

05:38.405 --> 05:40.305
...was close to completion.

05:41.635 --> 05:43.835
Then one day, you appeared.

05:44.675 --> 05:47.835
"Make him the strongest
Dragon Drive player of them all."

05:47.875 --> 05:49.845
Those were President Toki's orders.

05:50.445 --> 05:53.645
At the time, the first thing
that crossed my mind was...

05:54.145 --> 05:57.115
...I had finally been promoted to Agent,
yet my responsibilities were to baby-sit you.

05:57.855 --> 06:00.515
But there was nothing for me to teach you.

06:01.355 --> 06:04.255
You were already
the strongest warrior around.

06:05.225 --> 06:08.125
As you continued to train
under my supervision...

06:08.295 --> 06:10.785
...I became more and more impressed
with your skills.

06:12.335 --> 06:14.265
The more I watched you...

06:14.305 --> 06:16.735
...the more I thought of you as family.

06:17.275 --> 06:18.435
Strange, don't you think?

06:18.905 --> 06:20.535
At first, I couldn't stand you...

06:21.045 --> 06:23.035
...but soon I thought of you as a brother.

06:24.175 --> 06:25.645
We were always together...

06:25.915 --> 06:27.745
...so I can't help but worry about you!

06:29.915 --> 06:31.145
That's so boring.

06:31.655 --> 06:33.145
I don't want to hear any more.

06:33.325 --> 06:36.345
I can understand why you'd lose your cool
after being yelled at by your father...

06:36.555 --> 06:38.325
...and try to make up for your mistake.

06:38.695 --> 06:40.885
But what you need right now is some rest!

06:41.225 --> 06:43.995
Frankly, I don't think an Agent like you
should be forcing his opinions on me.

06:44.265 --> 06:46.295
No, Kouhei! I was just...

06:46.435 --> 06:48.565
I have to be going.

06:49.175 --> 06:52.235
So I can achieve the ultimate ending
that my dad desires.

06:52.305 --> 06:53.295
But!

06:53.475 --> 06:57.035
I get pissed off just looking at you.

06:57.275 --> 06:58.265
Kouhei...

06:59.185 --> 07:00.405
All right.

07:00.915 --> 07:02.715
I'm taking a break.
You wanna come with me?

07:03.155 --> 07:04.315
What are you planning?

07:04.955 --> 07:06.355
Just follow me, and you'll see.

07:41.025 --> 07:43.715
What was that? It startled me.

07:59.305 --> 08:01.295
Where are you, Reiji Ohzora?

08:04.545 --> 08:05.775
From the way things look...

08:05.815 --> 08:07.745
...it'll be impossible to see him from the sky.

08:47.725 --> 08:49.715
This brings back memories!

08:51.625 --> 08:52.955
What are you trying to do?

08:53.225 --> 08:54.525
Isn't it obvious?

08:54.695 --> 08:57.135
Give me something strong, like you used to.

08:58.705 --> 09:00.095
The rules are simple!

09:00.205 --> 09:02.865
If I lose to the dragon you create...

09:02.905 --> 09:04.805
...I'll give up my plan to return to Rikyu!

09:05.075 --> 09:05.935
But!

09:06.175 --> 09:07.905
Just hurry up and give me something!

09:08.275 --> 09:10.475
You wanna stop me
from going to Rikyu, right?

09:12.945 --> 09:13.935
All right.

09:15.285 --> 09:17.115
Then let's begin.

09:28.235 --> 09:30.355
What, these guys again?

09:30.635 --> 09:33.965
I've made some modifications
to their original battle data.

09:34.205 --> 09:36.325
You won't be disappointed.

09:36.975 --> 09:39.875
Really. I can't wait to see.

09:39.905 --> 09:41.005
Let's begin.

09:41.175 --> 09:42.405
Okay!

10:04.795 --> 10:06.425
Something's giving me the creeps.

10:06.665 --> 10:08.635
It feels like someone's watching me.

10:13.545 --> 10:15.535
Don't scare me like that, Chibi.

10:16.015 --> 10:17.535
Honestly...

10:23.955 --> 10:25.385
There's no mistake about it.

10:26.025 --> 10:27.015
This feeling.

10:27.125 --> 10:30.285
There's something here...
something incredible.

10:33.795 --> 10:35.995
I don't see how this is
worthwhile at this stage!

10:45.975 --> 10:49.305
Hey! You've gotta be kidding! Is this it?

10:49.575 --> 10:52.245
Well, I was mistaken
to have expected anything more.

10:52.445 --> 10:53.915
Good job, Kouhei!

10:54.045 --> 10:55.575
But the real battle is just beginning!

11:00.885 --> 11:01.875
Wow!

11:02.125 --> 11:03.645
I've never seen this dragon before!

11:03.725 --> 11:05.245
Looks like fun!

11:11.265 --> 11:13.065
Well, it's pretty good!

11:14.305 --> 11:18.895
This XD-03 Glory was created
using your battle data!

11:19.145 --> 11:21.135
You could say it's another you!

11:21.375 --> 11:23.205
Don't believe you can easily defeat it!

11:27.185 --> 11:29.815
Hmm. Another me?

11:30.155 --> 11:33.175
So in other words,
I'm fighting against myself!

11:33.785 --> 11:37.315
Needless to say, I've added to its powers
to give it a definite advantage!

11:37.355 --> 11:40.025
This'll teach you that there's always
someone stronger waiting for you!

11:40.125 --> 11:42.395
You sound awfully confident!

11:42.665 --> 11:44.095
But comments like that...

11:44.135 --> 11:47.265
...should be saved for after you defeat me
and Light Night's Knight.

11:54.945 --> 11:55.915
What's wrong?

11:56.915 --> 11:58.905
You don't have anything else to say?

12:16.695 --> 12:18.255
Sorry, Kouhei.

12:18.805 --> 12:21.325
I don't want to lose you.

12:25.045 --> 12:28.335
I commend you, Agent G.

12:29.215 --> 12:30.605
You win.

12:30.975 --> 12:33.475
Kouhei. So you understand!

12:34.045 --> 12:37.845
From now on, I'll be a good boy
and do exactly as you say.

12:38.115 --> 12:39.105
Kouhei.

12:40.755 --> 12:41.815
Fooled you!

12:43.155 --> 12:44.145
Wha!

12:45.895 --> 12:47.555
You just don't get it!

12:54.605 --> 12:56.795
How can you create another me?

12:56.875 --> 12:58.605
You're underestimating what I'm capable of!

12:58.945 --> 13:01.205
This can never match my abilities!

13:01.675 --> 13:03.665
I'm number one!

13:03.915 --> 13:05.575
Anytime! And anywhere!

13:06.245 --> 13:09.645
Because I'm the main character in this game!

13:09.755 --> 13:11.185
K-Kouhei.

13:11.415 --> 13:16.015
That's why those who get in my way
are destined to disappear!

13:16.295 --> 13:17.285
Kouhei.

13:17.495 --> 13:18.655
Y-You're!

13:18.825 --> 13:20.795
Whoever that may be!

13:40.415 --> 13:42.785
Kouhei! What are you trying to do?!

13:42.955 --> 13:44.005
Stop it!

13:44.055 --> 13:46.025
If you do that, the system will!

13:46.325 --> 13:48.785
Stop it, Kouhei! Kouhei!

13:49.955 --> 13:51.285
You're so irritating.

13:51.325 --> 13:54.355
In the end, I always win!

13:55.265 --> 13:57.425
Because I'm the hero here!

14:08.475 --> 14:10.345
He fainted from that?

14:10.375 --> 14:12.105
That's pretty pathetic.

14:12.315 --> 14:14.805
Well, I hope you get lots of rest.

14:28.795 --> 14:30.285
I'm not going.

14:30.695 --> 14:34.795
But I have an obligation
to take you home safely.

14:35.275 --> 14:37.965
I don't want you
involved in any battles.

14:38.505 --> 14:41.495
I got them all involved
in this battle against RI-ON.

14:42.345 --> 14:45.145
So I can't just stand by
and do nothing but watch.

14:45.445 --> 14:48.505
I don't think you need to put
so much pressure on yourself.

14:52.055 --> 14:53.955
Okay then. I won't stop you.

14:54.325 --> 14:55.315
I'm sorry.

14:55.495 --> 14:57.985
I realize that you've come all the way here
because my sister asked you to.

15:02.365 --> 15:03.955
I'm going to protect you.

15:04.335 --> 15:05.425
I promise.

15:05.805 --> 15:06.785
Thank you.

15:16.015 --> 15:17.915
You finding it difficult to wait, Maiko?

15:17.975 --> 15:19.535
- Huh?
- Hey!

15:19.585 --> 15:22.075
You can't stop thinking about Reiji, can you?!

15:22.215 --> 15:24.015
Th-That's not it!

15:24.885 --> 15:26.975
We've now brought together
the team we need.

15:27.525 --> 15:29.515
All that's left is to wait for Reiji's return.

15:29.625 --> 15:30.355
Right?

15:30.395 --> 15:31.855
I'll go and get him!

15:31.895 --> 15:34.365
Hey! Just like I thought!
Then I'm going too!

15:34.495 --> 15:37.895
Don't do it! By going now,
you'll only be getting in his way.

15:38.135 --> 15:39.865
Aren't you worried, Rockaku?

15:40.535 --> 15:42.935
What'll happen if Reiji never returns?!

15:43.375 --> 15:45.635
He'll return. I know it.

15:48.505 --> 15:50.505
I know he'll be back.

15:50.915 --> 15:54.045
So let's wait for him to return.

15:55.615 --> 15:56.605
Reiji...

16:03.925 --> 16:05.225
Where is it?

16:05.465 --> 16:06.895
Where could it be?

16:07.095 --> 16:08.565
That legendary dragon!

16:13.635 --> 16:16.395
I'm sure of it! I can feel it!

16:18.675 --> 16:20.975
There's something or someone watching me!

16:24.615 --> 16:25.605
But where?

16:26.715 --> 16:27.905
Where is it?

16:29.385 --> 16:34.415
If you're around here,
show yourself!

16:37.255 --> 16:39.415
No way! I'll never find him.

16:40.525 --> 16:43.425
But I can't turn back now!

16:46.035 --> 16:48.595
If I give up now,
all this training will be put to waste!

16:48.635 --> 16:52.435
Why have you come all this way,
Reiji Ohzora?!

16:59.615 --> 17:01.915
O-Oh, no!

17:04.915 --> 17:06.405
Body code confirmed!

17:06.455 --> 17:08.425
Transfer output normal!

17:08.455 --> 17:10.615
D-System, green, proceed!

17:17.235 --> 17:18.425
See ya!

17:45.225 --> 17:46.885
I-Is that SinnSaber?!

17:46.925 --> 17:48.155
There you are!

17:48.225 --> 17:49.455
Reiji Ohzora!

17:54.005 --> 17:55.335
Hikaru!

17:57.605 --> 17:59.165
S-Someone's with you?

18:04.315 --> 18:05.335
Who's this?

18:05.385 --> 18:07.845
He's a hunter who is
pursuing the legendary dragon.

18:08.445 --> 18:09.845
I found him lying here.

18:10.555 --> 18:11.645
Hikaru.

18:11.685 --> 18:12.585
Wh-What?

18:12.625 --> 18:16.285
You are very kind to help
an injured person.

18:16.425 --> 18:17.685
Don't get me wrong.

18:17.725 --> 18:19.025
I just found him here by coincidence.

18:19.365 --> 18:21.625
Oh boy,
why can't you just accept a compliment?

18:23.595 --> 18:24.565
He's awake.

18:25.095 --> 18:26.365
Where am I?

18:30.435 --> 18:32.905
What's wrong? We're not going to hurt you!

18:32.945 --> 18:34.275
H-Help me!

18:34.305 --> 18:35.965
We were mistaken!

18:36.045 --> 18:37.945
We were all defeated in a mere instant!

18:38.345 --> 18:39.405
Terrifying.

18:39.585 --> 18:40.975
That thing's a monster.

18:41.015 --> 18:43.385
Th-That thing?!
You mean, the legendary dragon?

18:43.485 --> 18:44.845
Do you mean SinnSaber?

18:44.885 --> 18:47.375
I'm gonna be killed! We'll all be killed!

18:47.425 --> 18:49.585
It's unbeatable! We're doomed!

18:49.795 --> 18:51.385
There's nothing to be afraid of.

18:51.695 --> 18:52.855
Help me!

18:52.895 --> 18:55.725
I don't wanna die! I don't wanna die!

18:57.595 --> 18:59.255
It must be nearby.

18:59.535 --> 19:01.005
Let's go, Chibi!

19:01.535 --> 19:02.435
Hikaru!

19:05.445 --> 19:08.235
You really are a pest.

19:08.705 --> 19:10.045
It's written all over your face...

19:10.075 --> 19:12.745
...that you're not going to let me
through without a fight!

19:13.815 --> 19:15.115
Okay, okay.

19:15.145 --> 19:17.145
I give in to your persistence.

19:17.685 --> 19:20.625
I just can't understand
why you wanna fight me so badly.

19:20.885 --> 19:22.585
But I have one condition.

19:23.055 --> 19:25.755
If I win, we'll fight Kouhei Toki together.

19:25.895 --> 19:27.755
Got that?! Then let's get started!

19:30.095 --> 19:32.085
H-Hey! Wait a minute!

19:33.635 --> 19:35.935
I've agreed to fight you!

19:36.035 --> 19:37.265
Where do you think you're going?!

19:37.305 --> 19:38.705
I'm tired of you using the same tactics.

19:38.735 --> 19:40.435
- You can't trick me twice.
- Huh?

19:40.675 --> 19:42.605
You were going to run away again.

19:42.675 --> 19:44.615
Run away? I'm not going to run.

19:44.715 --> 19:46.615
I just... um...

19:46.945 --> 19:47.935
Look.

19:48.415 --> 19:50.285
The hunter was right...

19:50.385 --> 19:53.375
...the legendary dragon
is incredibly powerful.

19:54.985 --> 19:56.955
The legendary dragon, SinnSaber, huh.

19:57.655 --> 19:59.125
I've now become interested
in fighting against it.

19:59.365 --> 20:00.345
Don't be silly!

20:00.395 --> 20:02.155
I'm the one who's gonna defeat SinnSaber!

20:02.195 --> 20:04.285
That's the whole reason we've come this far.

20:05.535 --> 20:07.725
So you're going to fight SinnSaber
no matter what?

20:07.765 --> 20:09.135
Of course!

20:09.305 --> 20:11.135
But there is only one SinnSaber.

20:11.235 --> 20:12.965
There can be only one opponent.

20:13.245 --> 20:17.105
We must battle to determine
who will fight SinnSaber.

20:17.145 --> 20:18.975
That brings us back to the same problem,

20:19.085 --> 20:20.805
...and I don't want to fight you.

20:20.885 --> 20:21.875
I figured you'd say so.

20:22.045 --> 20:23.515
Hey. Where are you going?

20:23.685 --> 20:25.705
I'm going to fight SinnSaber.

20:25.755 --> 20:27.055
Wh-What?!

20:27.355 --> 20:29.055
Whether you want to or not...

20:29.125 --> 20:30.645
...I will defeat you...

20:30.855 --> 20:32.455
...and then I'll fight SinnSaber.

20:32.695 --> 20:33.685
Hikaru...

20:34.095 --> 20:36.325
You can either beat me
to earn the right to fight SinnSaber...

20:36.595 --> 20:40.325
...or fall to your knees before me.
It's one or the other.

20:42.205 --> 20:44.335
You don't have the time to think it over.

20:44.805 --> 20:45.965
What'll you do?

20:46.005 --> 20:47.165
Reiji Ohzora.

20:48.205 --> 20:49.335
Okay.

20:49.815 --> 20:51.205
I'll fight against you!

20:53.285 --> 20:55.845
Now that you're no longer helping RI-ON...

20:56.055 --> 20:58.845
...I don't believe I have
any reason to fight you!

20:58.925 --> 21:00.145
However...

21:00.355 --> 21:04.655
...I must defeat the legendary dragon
and become more powerful!

21:04.925 --> 21:07.195
That's more like it.

21:16.905 --> 21:17.835
Hikaru.

21:17.875 --> 21:19.165
I'll beat you...

21:19.205 --> 21:21.305
...and defeat the legendary dragon,
no matter what it takes!

21:21.345 --> 21:23.905
Let's do it, Reiji Ohzora!

21:56.045 --> 21:58.775
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.775 --> 22:01.545
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.545 --> 22:05.505
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.955 --> 22:09.725
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.725 --> 22:11.915
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.365 --> 22:16.495
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.895 --> 22:20.565
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.565 --> 22:23.305
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.305 --> 22:27.295
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.605 --> 22:31.115
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.115 --> 22:34.115
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.115 --> 22:39.015
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.655 --> 22:42.395
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.395 --> 22:45.155
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.155 --> 22:49.825
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.535 --> 22:53.305
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.305 --> 22:55.975
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.975 --> 23:00.635
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.275 --> 23:05.805
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.715 --> 23:12.415
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.685 --> 23:17.385
Next time

23:17.825 --> 23:20.195
That Hikaru, he's such a pest!

23:20.825 --> 23:22.355
I have no choice but to fight him!

23:22.395 --> 23:23.765
Or so I thought, but then!

23:23.795 --> 23:25.925
Amazingly enough!

23:25.965 --> 23:27.995
A mysterious dragon
makes a sudden appearance!

23:28.205 --> 23:29.035
That's him, I'm sure of it!

23:29.075 --> 23:31.405
- That's the legendary dragon!
- SinnSaber!

23:31.435 --> 23:33.165
And he's so powerful!

23:33.205 --> 23:35.675
Both Hikaru and I get our butts kicked!

23:35.715 --> 23:36.875
Are you scared?

23:36.915 --> 23:39.375
Next, on Dragon Drive, "SinnSaber".

23:39.585 --> 23:41.645
No matter what, I'll acquire the power!

23:41.645 --> 23:44.485
SinnSaber
Never give up!
